{
  "id": "OBA.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "OBA",
  "reference": "Cobadyaah 1",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "OBA 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanu waa wixii la tusay Cobadyaah. Sayidka Rabbiga ahu sidan buu dalka Edom ka leeyahay: Annagu Rabbiga xaggiisa ayaannu war ka maqalnay, oo farriinwade ayaa quruumaha dhexdooda loo soo diray, isagoo leh, War kaca, oo kaalaya aan dadka Edom dagaal ugu kacnee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal eega, quruumaha dhexdooda waan idinku yareeyey, oo si weyn baa laydiin quudhsaday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwiinna qararka dillaacyadooda ku hoyda oo hoygoodu meesha sare ku yaal, waxaa idin khiyaanay kibirka qalbigiinna, oo waxaad qalbiga iska tidhaahdaan, Bal yaa dhulka nagu soo ridi kara? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In kastood meel kore fuushaan sida gorgorka, iyo in kastoo buulkiinna laga dhiso xiddigaha dhexdooda, halkaas waan idinka soo dejin doonaa, ayaa Rabbigu leeyahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddii tuugag idiin soo dhici lahaayeen ama haddii shufto habeennimo idin miri lahayd, sow wax idinkama xadi lahayn jeeray wax ku filan la tagaan? (Sidee baad u ba'deen!) Haddii kuwa canabka gura idiin iman lahaayeen, sow kama tegi lahayn canab xaaxaab ah? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidee baa loo dhacay alaabtii reer Ceesaw! Oo khasnadihiisii qarsoonaa sidee baa loo baadhay! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulli dadkii aad axdiga la lahaan jirteen oo dhammu waxay idinku celiyeen tan iyo soohdinta, oo dadkii nabadda idinla lahaan jiray ayaa idin khiyaanay, wayna idinka adkaadeen, oo kuwii kibistiina cuni jiray ayaa dabin idiin dhigay, oo innaba waxgarasho ma leh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Wakhtigaas ragga xigmadda leh sow kama aan baabbi'in doono reer Edom oo waxgarashadana sow kama baabbi'in doono buurta Ceesaw? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reer Teemaanow, raggiinna xoogga badanu way wada nixi doonaan, oo sidaas daraaddeed mid kasta oo buurta Ceesaw ka yimid ayaa laynta ku go'i doona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xumaantii aad walaalihiin reer Yacquub ku samayseen aawadeed ayaa ceebu idiinku degi doonta, oo weligiin baad go'naan doontaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, wakhtigii aad ag taagnaydeen oo iska fiirinayseen, markay shisheeyayaashu maalkooda qaadanayeen, oo dadka qalaad irdihooda soo gelayeen, oo ay Yeruusaalem saamiga u ridanayeen, xataa idinku iyagoo kalaad ahaydeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse ha fiirina wakhtiga walaalihiin cidhiidhiga ku jiraan, oo ha ku farxina wakhtiga reer Yahuudah baabba'ooda, oo hana u faanina wakhtiga cidhiidhiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iridda dadkayga ha soo gelina wakhtiga ay belaayaysan yihiin, oo weliba dhibkooda ha fiirsanina wakhtiga ay belaayaysan yihiin, oo maalkoodana far ha saarina wakhtiga ay belaayaysan yihiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo meesha jidadka isku gooyaana ha u istaagina si aad u laysaan kuwooda soo fakaday, oo kuwooda wakhtigii cidhiidhiga ka hadhayna cadowgooda ha u gacangelina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, maalintii Rabbigu way soo dhow dahay oo way ku dhici doontaa quruumaha oo dhan, oo sidaad samayseen ayaa idinkana laydiinku samayn doonaa, oo abaalgudkiinnii ayaa madaxiinna ku soo noqon doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidaad buurtayda quduuska ah korkeeda wax ugu cabteen ayaa quruumaha oo dhammuna had iyo goorba wax u cabbi doonaan, haah, iyagu way cabbi doonaan oo way liqi doonaan, oo waxay ahaan doonaan sidii iyagoo aan weligood ahaanin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Buur Siyoon waxaa joogi doona kuwa baxsaday, oo iyana quduus bay ahaan doontaa, oo reer Yacquubna waxay lahaan doonaan waxyaalihii dhaxalkoodii ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reer Yacquub dab buu ahaan doonaa, oo reer Yuusufna olol buu ahaan doonaa, reer Ceesawna bal jajab ah buu ahaan doonaa. Dhexdooday ku gubi doonaan oo iyagana way laasan doonaan, oo reer Ceesawna innaba waxba kama hadhi doonaan, waayo, Rabbigu sidaasuu ku hadlay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadka koonfur degganu waxay hantiyi doonaan buurta Ceesaw, oo kuwa bannaanka degganuna waxay hantiyi doonaan dalka reer Falastiin, oo weliba waxay hantiyi doonaan dalka reer Efrayim, iyo dalka reer Samaariya, oo reer Benyaamiinna waxay hantiyi doonaan dalka Gilecaad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo ciidankan dadka Israa'iil ee maxaabiista ahu waxay hantiyi doonaan dalka reer Kancaan tan iyo Sarefta, oo Yeruusaalem maxaabiisteeda Sefaaraad joogtaana waxay hantiyi doonaan magaalooyinka koonfureed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo badbaadiyayaaluna waa iman doonaan Buur Siyoon, si ay buurta Ceesaw u xukumaan, oo boqortooyadana waxaa lahaan doona Rabbiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
